% ===== THREE CONCENTRIC ZONES: TABERNACLE / WILDERNESS / PROMISE =====
% Drawn from the camp's own literal structure (2章): the tabernacle at the
% center, the wilderness of discipline around it, the promise at the rim.
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85, transform shape]
  % Outer zone — the promise: the plains of Moab, the land in view (26-36章)
  \fill[PromiseGold, opacity=0.16] (0,0.1) circle (1.65);
  \draw[PromiseGold, line width=0.9pt, opacity=0.75] (0,0.1) circle (1.65);
  % Middle zone — the wilderness of discipline (14, 20章)
  \fill[WildernessOchre, opacity=0.14] (0,0.1) circle (1.15);
  \draw[WildernessOchre, line width=1.0pt, opacity=0.85] (0,0.1) circle (1.15);
  % Inner zone — the tabernacle, the camp's ordered center (1-2章)
  \fill[ChapterNavy, opacity=0.22] (0,0.1) circle (0.55);
  \draw[ChapterNavy, line width=1.0pt, opacity=0.9] (0,0.1) circle (0.55);
  \node[font=\tiny,color=ChapterNavy] at (0,-0.65) {會幕居中};
  \node[font=\tiny,color=WildernessOchre] at (0,-1.28) {曠野管教};
  \node[font=\tiny,color=PromiseGold!70!black]  at (0,-1.9) {應許之地};
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.10cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.8in}{0.8pt}}
\vspace{0.24cm}

{\fontsize{34}{40}\selectfont\bfseries\color{ChapterNavy}\kaiti\selectfont 應許}\\[0.10cm]
{\fontsize{16}{20}\selectfont\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} Promise}

\vspace{0.20cm}
{\fontsize{22}{26}\selectfont\bfseries\kaiti\selectfont 民數記研讀}\\[0.08cm]
{\fontsize{13}{16}\selectfont\itshape\color{TextGray} A Study of the Book of Numbers}

\vspace{0.24cm}
{\fontsize{15}{18}\selectfont\itshape\color{ChapterNavy} בְּמִדְבַּר}\quad
{\footnotesize\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} “Bemidbar”}\quad
{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{WildernessOchre} 在曠野}

\vfill

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{WildernessOchre}\kaiti\selectfont
「神非人，必不致說謊，也非人子，必不致後悔。祂說話豈不照著行呢？祂發言豈不要成就呢？」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“God is not a man, that He should lie, nor a son of man, that He should repent; has He said, and will He not do it?”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{ChapterNavy} 民數記 23:19 \textperiodcentered\ Numbers 23:19}
\vspace{0.15cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

